; ====================================================================================================
; THE ASH THRONE (the finish run, Act IV) — where Morthul is fought and the world's future is chosen.
;
; The highest dais in the realm (region_spec_celestial.py THRONE, levelled flat across 44 x 40 m),
; centred at cell-local (-29, -37). The road from the Knight's gate arrives at the dais's south edge;
; the throne stands at its north edge with its back to the void, flanked by its two fires.
;
;   Brazier/Summon  BossSummonComponent. ⚠️ GATED ON A FLAG, NOT A QUEST: RequiredQuestId is empty
;                   and RequiredFlagId = flag.ashen_knight_defeated, so the Ash King cannot be
;                   challenged until his Knight has fallen. Morthul rises at the dais centre:
;                   brazier (-29, -21) plus SpawnOffset (0, 0, -16).
;   AddSpawns/*     found by GROUP "boss_add_spawn" (BossController scopes them to this scene), for
;                   his ashen waves — ringed round him, clear of him and of the throne.
; The dais floor stays bare; the pillars and the throne are on its rim.
; ====================================================================================================
